                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game is a blast to play with a few friends or even against the AI bots.  It's easy to pick up and play but hard to master.  You need to think a few moves ahead like speed chess, only with hot lead.  Do you use your fast shot to pick off someone before quickly moving on, use the slow shot to trap your enemy while you reload, or let your friends pick each other off while laying low?\nBang Bang Bang is a great addition to your party game rotation.\n",
